hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"276","[AI-translation] Jab raat chha jaae—ya sham kar lo—to bacchon ko roko, shaitan us waqt phailte hain; raat ki ek ghadi guzre to chhod do. Darwaze band karo aur Allah ka naam lo; shaitan band darwaza nahin kholta. Mashkeeze baandho aur Allah ka naam lo, bartan dhaanpo aur Allah ka naam lo, chahe upar koi cheez rakho, aur chiraagh bujha do. [Sham ke adab]"
